node_modules/
dist/
# Simulator CLI output. Anchored to the root: unanchored, this also matched
# qa/reports/ and silently swallowed every QA cycle report.
/reports/
*.tsbuildinfo

# QA measurement scratch. The scripts under qa/scratch/ are the method and are
# tracked, because a figure in a run log is only reproducible if the harness
# that produced it is. The data they emit is not: constructed league snapshots
# alone run to 800MB, and every byte of it is regenerable from a seed.
qa/scratch/**/*.json
qa/scratch/**/*.log
